Celaray is a Water elemental Pal. Riding the wind, this Pal travels where it pleases. Should it find a partner along the way, the encounter will mark its journey's end. Celaray is a pal resembling a flying manta ray. Its body is light blue with large wing-like pectoral fins around three times the size of its body in length. On each fin there is three white spots of varying sizes. The underside of Celaray is a lighter blue. Celaray has long cephalic fins on its head resembling rabbit ears, the tip of the cephalic fins are a light yellow. The eyes of Celaray are red and on each side next to the eyes feature two markings that are light yellow like the tips of the cephalic fins. The bottom of Celaray has small pelvic fins that resemble hands or feet. A very carefree Pal that is almost always found near beaches and shorelines, never straying too far from the sea. It is perpetually floating, though it never gets that high off the ground. It even sleeps while floating! Wild Celaray are generally pacific and may fly away from the player, only resorting to aggressiveness when attacked.

